  "originalQuery": "Your organization is building a social networking platform where users can follow others and view their activity feeds. The application requires a database solution that can efficiently handle complex relationships between users and their activities, as well as scale horizontally. Which of the following database types best suits the requirements of this project?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Document NoSQL Database<br/>B. Column-family NoSQL Database<br/>C. Graph NoSQL Database<br/>D. Key-value NoSQL Database",
