  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "248",
  "tip": "<p>Map the access pattern to the data model. When you see <i>highly connected</i> data and repeated <i>traversals</i> think <i>graph</i>. When you see flexible JSON and hierarchical records think <i>document</i>. When you see simple lookups at massive scale think <i>key value</i>. When you see strong relational consistency and SQL at global scale think <i>Spanner</i>.</p>",
